{"4073220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Commanders Fury", "steam_appid": 4073220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of the war machine of an empire in this 4x RTS hybrid. Fight battles with your flagship fleet in fully 3D real-time space combat. Recruit, train and dispatch commanders. Give them orders, directives and equip their fleets. Manage your empire’s supply logistics and fleet operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ships are fully simulated with different damageable hull sections, armor plates, interior components, and weapons. As their weapons and components get damaged, the ship’s stats and abilities get affected. Ships also have vulnerabilities such as weak rear or belly armor. Different weapons have different damage pierce values. High piercing weapons like torpedoes are able easily go through thin armor and reach deep vital components.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073220/extras/e12fb386ecdc77f1f05acdec611c457e.poster.avif?t=1770955248\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073220/extras/e12fb386ecdc77f1f05acdec611c457e.webm?t=1770955248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073220/extras/e12fb386ecdc77f1f05acdec611c457e.mp4?t=1770955248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an immersive campaign where you start out as a ship captain and move up all the way to Grand Admiral. Build and upgrade ships, war factories, shipyards, starbases and planetary defenses. Recruit officers from a pool of candidates, promote them by leveling up their skills with training and experience and then dispatch them to other fleets to conduct fleet operations according to your orders and directives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073220/extras/8ec44eacc2acac0c38b3764343ffa6c1.poster.avif?t=1770955248\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073220/extras/8ec44eacc2acac0c38b3764343ffa6c1.webm?t=1770955248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073220/extras/8ec44eacc2acac0c38b3764343ffa6c1.mp4?t=1770955248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commander's Fury takes starship combat to the next level with 3D formations, 3D fleet maneuvers, 3D firing arcs and 3D damage. Command a squadron of starships. Form them into a 3 dimensional formation that can engage multiple enemy fleets from different directions.  Each weapon on each ship has 3d firing arcs that must be taken into account in combat. Ships also have vulnerable directions where they need to avoid being attacked from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073220/extras/ae2ba868123b41085a006b5cfbdcd41e.poster.avif?t=1770955248\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073220/extras/ae2ba868123b41085a006b5cfbdcd41e.webm?t=1770955248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073220/extras/ae2ba868123b41085a006b5cfbdcd41e.mp4?t=1770955248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4X RTS hybrid campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully 3D Real-time fleet combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed star map with 19 star systems and over 50 planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 ships filling different roles including 5 command ships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable ship loadouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and train commanders with skill trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 types of weapons each with different special effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully simulated ships with damageable components affecting stats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of the war machine of an empire in this 4x RTS hybrid. Fight battles with your flagship fleet in fully 3D real-time space combat. Recruit, train and dispatch commanders. Give them orders, directives and equip their fleets. Manage your empire’s supply logistics and fleet operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ships are fully simulated with different damageable hull sections, armor plates, interior components, and weapons. As their weapons and components get damaged, the ship’s stats and abilities get affected. Ships also have vulnerabilities such as weak rear or belly armor. Different weapons have different damage pierce values. High piercing weapons like torpedoes are able easily go through thin armor and reach deep vital components.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073220/extras/e12fb386ecdc77f1f05acdec611c457e.poster.avif?t=1770955248\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https: