oid being attacked from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073220/extras/ae2ba868123b41085a006b5cfbdcd41e.poster.avif?t=1770955248\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073220/extras/ae2ba868123b41085a006b5cfbdcd41e.webm?t=1770955248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073220/extras/ae2ba868123b41085a006b5cfbdcd41e.mp4?t=1770955248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4X RTS hybrid campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully 3D Real-time fleet combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed star map with 19 star systems and over 50 planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 ships filling different roles including 5 command ships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable ship loadouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and train commanders with skill trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 types of weapons each with different special effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully simulated ships with damageable components affecting stats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Take command of the war machine of an empire in this 4x RTS hybrid. Fight battles with your flagship fleet in fully 3D real-time space combat. Recruit, train and dispatch commanders. Give them orders, directives and equip their fleets. Manage your empire’s supply logistics and fleet operations.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite